      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Collaborating with the Government Technology Agency of Singapore (GovTech Singapore) to protect users without compromising privacy.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/on-device-ai-scam-detection-mddi/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T02:00:14.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:07:35.575Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Scams, such as investment fraud, fake job offers, and impersonation of public officials make up over half of Singapore’s reported crimes, and account for more than S$4 billion in losses since 2019 .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/on-device-ai-scam-detection-mddi/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T02:00:14.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:07:35.575Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To address this, Google DeepMind and the Government Technology Agency of Singapore (GovTech Singapore) have been working together as part of our National AI Partnership with the Singapore Government.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/on-device-ai-scam-detection-mddi/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T02:00:14.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:07:35.575Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Together, we've fine-tuned a privacy-preserving, on-device scam detection model.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/on-device-ai-scam-detection-mddi/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T02:00:14.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:07:35.575Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To address this, Google’s lightweight Gemma model was fine-tuned on local scam conversations.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/on-device-ai-scam-detection-mddi/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T02:00:14.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:07:35.575Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The roll out of the model within applications will be carefully phased and developed in partnership with the Singapore Government.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/on-device-ai-scam-detection-mddi/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T02:00:14.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:07:35.575Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "As the model runs entirely on-device, neither the Singapore Government nor Google, will be able to access users’ conversations through its deployment.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/on-device-ai-scam-detection-mddi/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T02:00:14.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:07:35.575Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Working with Google DeepMind, we're bringing advanced AI protection directly onto citizens' devices.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/on-device-ai-scam-detection-mddi/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T02:00:14.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:07:35.575Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Stage 2: In-context analysis with our fine-tuned Gemma model, where we analyze a larger snapshot of the conversation to confirm a threat or discard a false alarm.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/on-device-ai-scam-detection-mddi/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T02:00:14.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:07:35.575Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Presented at Singapore International Cyber Week (SICW 2026), this collaboration provides a model for messaging platforms balancing user protection with end-to-end encryption.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/on-device-ai-scam-detection-mddi/",
